From a851187d5d1f02f3ff9ef2af1b319971046a30d7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Weidong Sun <sunweidong@linux.alibaba.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 15:25:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] node: publish volume metadata atomically and recover after
 restart

Return the provider's cloud device identity in controller responses so
NodePublish can resume after plugin restart. Keep ownership and mount
properties consistent on republish and publish metadata with rename.

Accept existing upstream metadata without version labels or Pod identity
fields. Remove only empty targets and retain metadata when target cleanup
fails, allowing an unpublish retry to finish.

Co-authored-by: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
